{
  "name": "Schedule social posts from an RSS feed with AI captions in Nadia",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule social posts from an RSS feed\n\n> **Self-hosted n8n only.** This template uses the `n8n-nodes-nadia` community node, which n8n has not verified yet. Install it first: Settings -> Community Nodes -> Install -> `n8n-nodes-nadia`.\n\nEvery hour this workflow reads an RSS feed, keeps the items published since the last run, asks an AI model for a caption, and schedules each post on a Nadia channel in the next free slot of its posting schedule. A burst of ten articles does not become ten posts in ten minutes.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Every hour** starts the run.\n2. **Your settings** holds the feed URL.\n3. **Read the feed** fetches it, and **Only new items** drops anything older than the interval, so an item is never posted twice.\n4. **Write the caption** turns the title and summary into a caption.\n5. **Schedule the post** creates the post with *Use Next Free Slot* on.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Add your **Nadia** credential: API key from Settings -> Developers in Nadia, host `https://app.usenadia.com/api`.\n2. Put your feed URL in **Your settings**.\n3. Add your OpenAI credential to **Caption model**, or swap it for another chat model.\n4. Open **Schedule the post**, pick your channel, then close and reopen the node: its settings load at that moment. Fill them.\n\n### Customize\n\nSet the post type to *Draft* to review everything in the calendar first.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 760
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read the feed\nHourly, keep only what is new since the last run.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Write the caption\nThe title and summary become a caption written for social.",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule it\nNadia picks the next free slot of that channel.",
        "width": 320,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "sticky-note3",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1260,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "every-hour",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "feed-url",
              "name": "feedUrl",
              "value": "https://example.com/feed.xml",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "your-settings",
      "name": "Your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.feedUrl }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "read-the-feed",
      "name": "Read the feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isoDate }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $now.minus(1, 'hour').toISO() }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "dateTime",
                "operation": "after"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "only-new-items",
      "name": "Only new items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a social media caption for this article. Two or three sentences, no hashtags, no emoji, end with the link.\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nSummary: {{ $json.contentSnippet }}\nLink: {{ $json.link }}",
        "messages": {}
      },
      "id": "write-the-caption",
      "name": "Write the caption",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "caption-model",
      "name": "Caption model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "createPost",
        "channelId": "",
        "type": "schedule",
        "useFreeSlot": true,
        "content": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "media": "",
        "settings": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {}
        },
        "additionalFields": {
          "shortLink": true
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-the-post",
      "name": "Schedule the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-nadia.nadia",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "nadiaApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Nadia account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Your settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Your settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
